sequenceDiagram
  actor Booker
  participant API as TideGrid API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Stripe
  participant Queue

  Booker->>API: Create checkout with Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: Lock capacity, resources, equipment, package
  DB-->>API: Commit holds, order, attempt, outbox
  API->>Stripe: Create PaymentIntent on connected account
  Stripe-->>Booker: Payment UI and action
  Stripe->>API: Signed payment webhook
  API->>DB: Insert webhook inbox
  API-->>Stripe: 2xx
  API->>Queue: Enqueue inbox ID
  Queue->>API: Process payment event
  API->>DB: Convert holds and confirm booking atomically
  alt Holds expired
    API->>DB: Attempt atomic reacquisition
    alt Any requirement unavailable
      API->>Stripe: Full refund and fee reversal
      API->>DB: Record exception and refund reconciliation
    end
  end
